      "description": "<fullname>Amazon Web Services Application Discovery Service</fullname> <p>Amazon Web Services Application Discovery Service helps you plan application migration projects. It automatically identifies servers, virtual machines (VMs), and network dependencies in your on-premises data centers. For more information, see the <a href=\"http://aws.amazon.com/application-discovery/faqs/\">Amazon Web Services Application Discovery Service FAQ</a>. Application Discovery Service offers three ways of perfor...",
