      "name": "Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager",
      "description": "<fullname>Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager</fullname> <p>With Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager, you can manage the lifecycle of your Amazon Web Services resources. You create lifecycle policies, which are used to automate operations on the specified resources.</p> <p>Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager supports Amazon EBS volumes and snapshots. For information about using Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager with Amazon EBS, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/snapshot-lifecycle.htm...",
