      "id": "amazonaws-com-sso-oidc",
      "name": "AWS SSO OIDC",
      "description": "<p>AWS IAM Identity Center (successor to AWS Single Sign-On) OpenID Connect (OIDC) is a web service that enables a client (such as AWS CLI or a native application) to register with IAM Identity Center. The service also enables the client to fetch the user\u2019s access token upon successful authentication and authorization with IAM Identity Center.</p> <note> <p>Although AWS Single Sign-On was renamed, the <code>sso</code> and <code>identitystore</code> API namespaces will continue to retain their...",
