      "description": "<p>Amazon Transcribe offers three main types of batch transcription: <b>Standard</b>, <b>Medical</b>, and <b>Call Analytics</b>.</p> <ul> <li> <p> <b>Standard transcriptions</b> are the most common option. Refer to for details.</p> </li> <li> <p> <b>Medical transcriptions</b> are tailored to medical professionals and incorporate medical terms. A common use case for this service is transcribing doctor-patient dialogue into after-visit notes. Refer to for details.</p> </li> <li> <p> <b>Call Ana...",
