    {
      "id": "nexmo-com-conversion",
      "name": "Nexmo Conversion API",
      "description": "The Conversion API allows you to tell Nexmo about the reliability of your 2FA communications. Sending conversion data back to us means that Nexmo can deliver messages faster and more reliably. The conversion data you send us is confidential: Nexmo does not share it with third parties. In order to identify the carriers who provide the best performance, Nexmo continually tests the routes we use to deliver SMS and voice calls. Using Adaptive Routing\u2122, Nexmo actively reroutes messages through dif...",
